<section class="section page-intro">
  <h1>Privacy by practical design</h1>
  <p>Seedexchange stores only the account, order and organization data needed to operate the service. Payment card data is handled by Stripe.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Public and private data</h2>
  <p>Organization profiles and published listings are public. Personal collections are private by default. Credentials and production configuration never belong in browser storage or the repository.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Operational records</h2>
  <p>Audit, notification, payment and moderation records are retained for security, support and legal obligations.</p>
</section>
